## 4. Canonical design direction

Current intended design decision **Rosewood & Almond** hai. Isko existing live tokens se verify karna aur usi ko standard banana.

- Rosewood: `#6F334B` — primary brand, important actions aur selected states.
- Ballet Blush: `#F3DDE4` — soft feminine surfaces aur subtle highlights.
- Almond Cream: `#F8F1E7` — warm page background.
- Espresso Cocoa: `#352A2D` — subtle lines, dots aur restrained decorative details.
- White neutral card/form surfaces ke liye allowed hai.
- Success, warning, error aur informational colours semantic roles mein hi rahenge.

Gold/champagne ko alag brand accent ki tarah dobara introduce mat karna. Legacy aliases ko tabhi retain karo jab current consumers un par depend karte hon; unhe safely migrate karne aur compatibility prove karne ke baad hi cleanup karo.

Colour choices ke saath contrast, readability aur disabled-state semantics bhi inspect karo. Decorative colour ka matlab text colour banana nahi hai.

## 5. UI/UX aur animation standards

World-class result ke liye sirf colour replacement kaafi nahi hai. Existing UI ko audit karo aur following consistency enforce karo:

- Shared typography, spacing, border, radius, elevation aur button conventions.
- Consistent, clearly visible keyboard focus rings; menus aur forms par gold focus rings nahi.
- Shared transition/easing tokens. Shimmer jaise equivalent skeleton animations ke liye ek canonical timing token.
- `prefers-reduced-motion` respect karo.
- Property photographs par hover zoom/scale mat lagao. Card lift ya subtle border/shadow feedback acceptable hai, jab reduced-motion mode mein disable ho.
- Responsive desktop, tablet aur mobile navigation; no unintended horizontal overflow, clipped menus ya inaccessible controls.
- Accessible labels, keyboard interactions, visible focus aur practical touch targets.
- Customer-facing text natural aur polished ho. Internal technical terminology customer UI mein mat dikhana.
- Pune-first experience ke current scope ko preserve karo. Bina contract ke new routes, fake inventory, unverified availability, prices, features ya backend capabilities invent mat karna.
- Existing hero property image URL ko palette work ke dauran change ya flip mat karna.
- Search, menu, save, compare aur discovery interactions ka existing behaviour preserve karo; sirf CSS ko dekhkar functionality ka assumption mat banana.

